{"id":47312,"ord":24,"n_segments":152,"prev":47311,"next":47313,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Harlem, the Cotton Club and Duke Ellington","title":"Trio with Putney Dandridge at the Onyx and the Spencer Williams recording","category":"band_or_employer","summary":"After Duke left he led a trio with Putney Dandridge at the Onyx, around the time he recorded with Spencer Williams.","period":"early 1930s","year_from":1930,"year_to":1933,"words":193,"start":[35,4],"end":[36,21],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125#s47312","tags":{"places":[{"name":"New York","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"St. Louis","focus":0,"type":"city"}],"venues":[{"name":"Onyx Club","focus":1,"city":"New York"}],"bands":[{"name":"Teddy Bunn trio","focus":1,"leader":"Teddy Bunn"},{"name":"Ben Bernie's Sepia Nephews","focus":0,"leader":"Ben Bernie"},{"name":"Duke Ellington Orchestra","focus":0,"leader":"Duke Ellington"}]},"people":[{"name":"Virgil Scoggins","qid":null,"n":3},{"name":"Putney Dandridge","qid":"Q1304616","n":2},{"name":"Duke Ellington","qid":"Q4030","n":1},{"name":"Doug Daniels","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"Wilber Daniels","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"Spencer Williams","qid":"Q1282480","n":1}],"story":{"theme":36,"theme_name":"Coming to New York: clubs, jams, and making it","community":73,"community_name":"Making it in New York: arrival, clubs and the scene","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":35,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"So then, anyway, you stayed in New York and Duke went out on the road."},{"p":35,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":35,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And was that about the time the Nephews formed up, or do you have your own group for awhile?"},{"p":35,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"I had a little trio."},{"p":35,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"A trio?"},{"p":35,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":35,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Who was in that?"},{"p":35,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Let me see, now."},{"p":35,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"The piano player that you mentioned? Was he still with you? Putney."},{"p":35,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Putney Dandridge, myself and -- let's see. Wow. Me, Putney and -- I had a little trio. There wasn't no bass in it at all."},{"p":35,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Was it drums, then, or a singer, or what?"},{"p":35,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"A drummer."},{"p":36,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"A drummer?"},{"p":36,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":36,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"It wasn't Virgil, though?"},{"p":36,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Virgil? No."},{"p":36,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"No. That was later."},{"p":36,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"I didn't know Virgil then."},{"p":36,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":36,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He's from St. Louis."},{"p":36,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah. I see."},{"p":36,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And Wilbur and Doug and all them is from St. Louis."},{"p":36,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"From St. Louis."},{"p":36,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":36,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"But you had a trio then."},{"p":36,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"I had a trio, yeah."},{"p":36,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"For a couple of years there."},{"p":36,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":36,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And that was playing at the Onyx or at the --"},{"p":36,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"At the Onyx."},{"p":36,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"At the Onyx, huh? Was that about the time that you recorded with Spencer Williams?"},{"p":36,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":36,"b":20,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":36,"b":21,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"That's during the year."}]}